# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. Nothing here is a nicety.
#
# The test suites check their answers against a real Bloom Books backup and
# against real vendor statements. Those are the shop's financial records --
# every sale, every supplier invoice, every bank row. They are found at run
# time from outside the repo (see tests/fixtures.js) and must never be copied
# in, so the patterns below are a second line of defence in case one ever is.
# Both shapes: the automatic one on sign-in is bloom-books-backup-<date>-<hhmm>,
# the manual Export button writes bloom-books-<date>. The narrower pattern
# missed the second for as long as it existed.
bloom-books-*.json
VenmoStatement_*.csv
Sales_Report_*.csv
# Bank and card exports, under the names those sites actually hand out.
Chase*.csv
activity*.csv
*.ofx
*.qfx

# Scratch copies used while checking a change in the browser
x-*.json
x-*.csv

node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
